---
import { routing } from "../../data/tft";
---

<section class="routing-visual visual-section">
  <p class="eyebrow">架构示意 / HYBRID ROUTING</p>
  <h2>确定性事实与策略推理，走不同路径</h2>
  <div class="scenario-controls" hidden>
    {routing.map((r) => (
      <button type="button" data-route={r.id} aria-pressed="false">
        “{r.example}”
      </button>
    ))}
    <button type="button" data-route="all" aria-pressed="true">
      查看完整架构
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="routing-trunk">
    <div class="flow-node">User Query</div>
    <div class="flow-node">AgentService</div>
    <div class="flow-node">Intent / Routing</div>
  </div>
  <div class="routing-branches">
    {routing.map((r) => (
      <article class="route-branch" data-branch={r.id}>
        <p class="eyebrow">{r.label}</p>
        <h3>{r.calls}</h3>
        <p>“{r.example}”</p>
        <ol>
          {r.steps.map((step) => (
            <li>{step}</li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>
  <p class="source-note">
    0 / 1 次 LLM
    调用是此架构两条设计路径的说明，不代表所有输入的实际运行保证。交互仅高亮路径，不执行真实查询。
  </p>
</section>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>(".routing-visual").forEach((root) => {
    root.querySelector<HTMLElement>(".scenario-controls")!.hidden = false;
    const buttons = root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>("[data-route]");
    buttons.forEach((b) =>
      b.addEventListener("click", () => {
        buttons.forEach((x) => x.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(x === b)));
        root
          .querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>("[data-branch]")
          .forEach((p) =>
            p.classList.toggle(
              "highlighted",
              p.dataset.branch === b.dataset.route,
            ),
          );
      }),
    );
  });
</script>
